<p>Drift is being retired by Clari + Salesloft on <strong>January 31, 2027</strong>. Your access can end sooner if your contract ends first, and remaining Drift data is scheduled for permanent deletion on May 1, 2027. Checked October 30, 2026 against the <a href="https://clari.my.site.com/customer/s/article/Drift-Sunset-FAQ">official Drift Sunset FAQ</a>. The right Drift alternative depends on what you used: AI sales conversations, lead routing, website chat, customer support, or email reply management.</p>
